sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP TLS Edge
    participant UI as Streamlit UI<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant API as Backend API<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant LLM as Ollama / OpenAI / Vertex<br/>11434 or 443/TCP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MC as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User, K8s: Flow 1: Conversational Recommendation

    User->>Route: HTTPS/443 — Open Planner UI
    Route->>UI: HTTP/8501 (TLS terminated)
    User->>UI: Describe deployment need<br/>"I need a chatbot for 1000 users"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/extract<br/>HTTP/8000
    API->>LLM: Extract intent (chat completion)<br/>HTTP/11434 or HTTPS/443<br/>Auth: None/API key/GCP creds
    LLM-->>API: Structured intent (model, use case, users)
    API->>API: Generate traffic profile & SLO targets
    API->>PG: Query benchmarks matching SLOs<br/>TCP/5432 Password auth
    PG-->>API: Matching configurations
    API->>HF: GET model metadata (params, arch)<br/>HTTPS/443 Optional HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>API: Model config & safetensors info
    API->>API: Score configs (accuracy, price,<br/>latency, complexity) & rank

    alt No benchmark data found
        API->>API: Roofline fallback via llm-optimizer<br/>(BentoML in-process)
        API->>PG: Persist estimated results<br/>TCP/5432
    end

    API->>API: Generate KServe YAML via Jinja2
    API-->>UI: Ranked recommendations + YAML<br/>HTTP response
    UI-->>User: Display recommendations<br/>HTTPS/443 via Route

    Note over User, K8s: Flow 2: Cluster Deployment

    User->>UI: Click "Deploy to Cluster"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/deploy-to-cluster<br/>HTTP/8000
    API->>API: Render KServe InferenceService<br/>or llm-d kustomize overlay (Jinja2)
    API->>K8s: kubectl apply -f (InferenceService CR)<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token auth
    K8s-->>API: Deployment status
    API-->>UI: Deployment result<br/>HTTP response
    UI-->>User: Show deployment status<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over User, K8s: Flow 3: Model Catalog Sync (Background)

    API->>MC: GET /api/v1/models (paginated)<br/>HTTPS/8443 Bearer token (SA)<br/>TLS via service-serving CA
    MC-->>API: Model list + artifacts
    API->>PG: Upsert benchmark records<br/>TCP/5432 Password auth

    Note over User, K8s: Flow 4: GPU Detection

    API->>K8s: List nodes (label: nvidia.com/gpu.product)<br/>HTTPS/6443 SA token auth
    K8s-->>API: Node GPU labels
    API->>API: Cache GPU types (TTL: 300s)
